1
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:05,760
To a nurse, finding a vein can be routine.

2
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:08,590
For a patient, it can feel like a long wait.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,080
Sometimes painful.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:14,680
But sometimes, the technology meant to help
still leaves the moment frustrating.

5
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:19,090
Because behind every vein
is a person waiting to feel reassured.

6
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:24,420
Then another nurse noticed —
and offered a different way.

7
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,080
She picked up VeinVision.

8
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:36,360
And this time, she could see
the veins more clearly.

9
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,970
Less hesitation. Less waiting.

10
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:45,320
And a patient who feels
a little more at ease.

11
00:00:53,010 --> 00:00:55,390
When you can see better,
you can care better.
